@startuml
!include style.puml
title SD03b — F06 research is separate from comparison
boundary "VenuesPanel / EventPlanningCLI" as V
control EventPlanningController as C
control EventPlanningFacade as F
participant VenueSearchTool as T
participant PlacesAPIClient as P
entity Event as E
participant EventPlanningAgent as A
participant VenueService as S
V -> C : researchVenues(eventId, query)
C -> F : researchVenues(eventId, query)
F -> T : execute(query + event location)
T -> P : searchPlaces(query)
P --> T : ToolResult / safe provider error
T --> F : ToolResult [success]
F -> E : addVenueOptions(result.options())
ref over F : SD07 persist candidates/evidence before returning success
F --> V : provider results (through controller)
note over V,E
  Provider failure is an error, not a successful empty/fabricated search.
  Alternative: addVenue(eventId, manually attributed VenueOption).
  Listings are not selected or booked venues.
end note
V -> C : compareVenues(eventId)
C -> F : compareVenues(eventId)
F -> A : compareVenues(event)
loop Each candidate
  A -> S : evaluate(event, venue)
  S --> A : deterministic fit / warnings
end
ref over A : SD08 AI narrative against scored candidates; Gemini still required
A -> S : rank(comparisons)
S --> A : ranked comparisons
A --> F : List<VenueComparison>
F -> E : storeVenueComparisons(comparisons)
ref over F : SD07 save captured state
F --> V : comparison evidence / uncertainties (through controller)
@enduml
